0634   3E 73                  MVI   A,"s"   
0636   C3 61 06               JMP   error   
0639                             ; e_hi: the inner loop read a reserved byte, 80h-FFh: X. But a word cell that
0639                             ; was never defined still holds 0000h, and the byte there is a JMP, C3h, in
0639                             ; every build: if the IP is in page zero, this was a call of an undefined
0639                             ; word. The call is undone, so the place is the call itself.
0639   04           E_HI:     INR   B   
063A   05                     DCR   B   
063B   C2 57 06               JNZ   e_resv   
063E   E5                     PUSH   H   
