06B3   39                     DAD   SP   ;   (the cell at DSTOP-2 was pushed with the
06B4                          ;*Macro unroll:  NEGH                    ;   first value and holds nothing)
06B4   E7                     DS   1-CPM,0E7h   ;   first value and holds nothing)
