0746                             ; =============================================================================
0746                             ;  The fast build (SPEED = 2)
0746                             ; 
0746                             ;  The inner loop is a table: 256 entries, the low bytes of the handlers'
0746                             ;  addresses in one page and the high bytes in the next. The dispatcher (at
0746                             ;  next0, and inline, as NEXTF, at the end of the fast build's own entries,
0746                             ;  so there is no jump back to it; the ordinary handlers end in JMP next0):
0746                             ; 
0746                             ;      LDAX B / INX B / XCHG / MOV L,A / MVI H,DTAB/256 /
0746                             ;      MOV A,M / INR H / MOV H,M / MOV L,A / PCHL
0746                             ; 
0746                             ;  So every entry starts with TOS in DE, not HL. The rest of the punctuation
0746                             ;  is reached through thunks into the ordinary handlers (XCHG / JMP handler);
0746                             ;  the letters and digits have one entry each, which knows its cell or its
0746                             ;  value already.
0746                             ; =============================================================================
0746   EB           FTSTORE:   XCHG      ; !
0747   C3 7B 01               JMP   h_store   
074A   EB           FTSTR:    XCHG      ; "
074B   C3 8F 01               JMP   h_str   
074E   EB           FTNUM:    XCHG      ; #
074F   C3 AC 01               JMP   h_num   
0752   EB           FTPRINT:   XCHG      ; $
0753   C3 9C 01               JMP   h_print   
0756   EB           FTEMIT:   XCHG      ; '
0757   C3 A6 01               JMP   h_emit   
075A   EB           FTCSTORE:   XCHG      ; .
075B   C3 86 01               JMP   h_cstore   
075E   EB           FTDIV:    XCHG      ; /
075F   C3 49 01               JMP   h_div   
0762   EB           FTKEY:    XCHG      ; ?
0763   C3 BB 01               JMP   h_key   
0766   EB           FTDEF:    XCHG      ; [
0767   C3 C8 00               JMP   h_def   
076A   EB           FTBREAK:   XCHG      ; \
076B   C3 B9 00               JMP   h_break   
076E   EB           FTALLOC:   XCHG      ; _
076F   C3 5B 00               JMP   h_alloc   
0772   EB           FTGRAVE:   XCHG      ; `
0773   C3 92 00               JMP   h_grave   
0776                             ; The commonest punctuation, written for the fast build: TOS in DE on the
0776                             ; way in, and the dispatcher inline on the way out.
0776   E1           FS_ADD:   POP   H   ; +
0777   19                     DAD   D   
